er button in Settings -> Skin: a simple click opens the folder where your custom skins live, with a README explaining everything. GlyphsFlow Glyph revamped: enemies killed by a Static Burst now set off a Static Burst of their own, for satisfying chain reactions across the screen.New Glyph: Rekindle (full game): lost Hyper Mode and Supernova come back if your combo keeps clim","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T22:36:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114026911","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:38:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5058280-1846651706691559","game_id":"steam-5058280","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest is LIVE! Mod support and an even juicier demo!","summary":"Grazed is in Steam Next Fest! 🎉 Next Fest is live, and the Grazed demo is free to play right now. Grazed is a fast-paced arcade roguelite packed with juice. Every run starts slow, then your combo snowballs: hundreds of slices, explosions, axes, lightning and black holes, until the whole screen is pure chaos. Die, upgrade, and come back stronger. What's new in the demo 🎨 New: Skin ModsYou can now mod Grazed! Swap the look of the enemies, and even the player, with your own images. Pick a skin in S","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:05:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691559","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:23:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5058280-1845383656396595","game_id":"steam-5058280","kind":"announcement","title":"The Grazed Demo is LIVE! Play free and climb the leaderboard!","summary":"⚔️ THE DEMO IS HERE! ⚔️The wait is over: you can now play Grazed for free!What is Grazed?Grazed is a fast incremental arcade game where every kill means getti